OL,3,GNEWSAChip shop staff stop 'man with
OL,4,Aknife' after he jumps over counter
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 18-year-old has been arrested in
OL,7,Fconnection to an alleged knife crime
OL,8,Fincident in a Cardiff chip shop.
OL,10,FAt about 05:00 BST on 20 September, a
OL,11,Fman entered The Chippy on St Mary
OL,12,FStreet and hopped over the counter
OL,13,Fbefore appearing to pick up a knife,
OL,14,FSouth Wales Police said.
OL,16,FStaff disarmed him and he was removed
OL,17,Ffrom the premises. No one was hurt and
OL,18,Fthe police were called once the suspect
OL,19,Fhad left the area.
OL,21,FThe man was later arrested and remains
OL,22,Fin police custody, the force said.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
